  "content": [
    {
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "t",
          "text": [
            "This app creates a community of pet owners as a way to connect their pets with other animals and meet nearby pet owners.",
            "In busy cities like NYC, interaction with neighbors is limited. There is no good way for pet owners to find companions for their pets or connect with others in their area."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "video",
          "size": "t",
          "src": "/media/petmania/petmania.mp4",
          "alt": "PetMania Video"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "size": "f",
          "text": ["Research"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "t",
          "text": [
            "Pet owners often need help with pet-sitting, and their pets need companionship. We started by making some proto-personas."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "size": "t2",
          "src": "/media/petmania/persona.webp",
          "alt": "PetMania Persona",
          "style": "border: none;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "size": "f",
          "text": ["Prototyping"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "t",
          "text": [
            "We sketched out ideas for the app screens on paper as a form of rapid prototyping.",
            "Common threads included giving users personalized options to choose types of pets they'd like to connect with. We also explored doubling the app as a photo-sharing service for pictures of their pets."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "size": "t2",
          "src": "/media/petmania/paper.webp",
          "alt": "PetMania Paper Sketches"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "t",
          "text": [
            "We designed 10 pages in Figma based on user testing from our lo-fi prototype, creating wireframes for each."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "size": "t2",
          "src": "/media/petmania/userflow.webp",
          "alt": "PetMania User Flow",
          "style": "border: none;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "t",
          "text": [
            "We mapped the full user flow to ensure smooth navigation between screens."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "size": "t2",
          "src": "/media/petmania/figma_p2.webp",
          "alt": "PetMania User Flow in Figma",
          "style": "border: none;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "size": "f",
          "text": ["Visual Design"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "t",
          "text": [
            "For its visual design, we chose a paw as the logo to convey trust, warmth and fun.",
            "We iterated on the color palette and chose a warm aqua blue and gold. The colors are reminiscent of a beach and reflect the app's playful, welcoming themes."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "size": "t2",
          "src": "/media/petmania/figma_p1.webp",
          "alt": "PetMania Figma Design",
          "style": "border: none;"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
